# Internal API of the Ingestion Service. Needs docker-compose.validation.yml, which publishes the
# port. How to run: http/README.md.
#
# Until #21 (CF-06) is merged only GET /status exists, and the others answer 404 "no route".
# Their expected results below are those of api/ingestion-openapi.yaml in that PR.

### Status of the service
# Expected: 200, ingestion-service
GET {{ingestion}}/status

### Ingest: invalid id
# Expected after CF-06: 400 INVALID_PARAMETER, field book_id
POST {{ingestion}}/ingest/0084

### Status of a book that is not stored
# Expected after CF-06: 200, not_available, path null
GET {{ingestion}}/ingest/status/999999

### Stored books
# Expected after CF-06: 200, count and books
GET {{ingestion}}/ingest/list
